		Lore: Smooth and statuesque, it resonates with the faded glory of lost underground empires. It beats with a hollow, echoing elegance.
	}

	LesionHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Lesion Heart
		Lore: A putrid, infected mass born of the Corruption's decay. It twitches spasmodically, oozing a sickly purple fluid.
	}

	IceHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Ice Heart
		Lore: Frozen solid, it beats with a slow, crystalline chime that chills the surrounding air. It holds the pristine, unforgiving silence of the tundra.
	}

	HoneyHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Honey Heart
		Lore: Sticky, sweet, and slow-beating, it is a testament to the tireless labor of the jungle's bees. It radiates a warm, soothing vitality.
	}

	HayHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Hay Heart
		Lore: Bound together from dried stalks, it feels light and pastoral. A comforting reminder of sunny days and simple harvests.
	}

	GraniteHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Granite Heart
		Lore: Hewn from the deep, crushing dark of the underground, it hums with raw elemental energy. A heavy, unyielding testament to the earth's pressure.
	}

	GlassHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Glass Heart
		Lore: Fragile and transparent, yet it holds a surprisingly warm and steady light. It shimmers with the fiery breath of the furnace that forged it.
	}

	FossilHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Fossil Heart
		Lore: An ancient relic pulled from the deep desert, carrying the echoes of extinct leviathans. It beats with a slow, calcified thud.
	}

	FleshHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Flesh Heart
		Lore: A grotesque, pulsating mass of meat and sinew stripped from the Crimson's depths. It squelches with a disturbing, wet rhythm.
	}

	EbonwoodHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Ebonwood Heart
		Lore: Twisted and gnarled from the corrupted trees, it harbors a dark and festering vitality. A grim reflection of nature gone horribly wrong.
	}

	EbonstoneHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Ebonstone Heart
		Lore: Carved from the unyielding rock of the Corruption, it beats with a cold, relentless malice. It longs to spread its vile shadows across the land.
	}

	EbonsandHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Ebonsand Heart
		Lore: Filled with the dark, suffocating grit of the Corrupt desert. It whispers maddening secrets of decay with every grainy pulse.
	}

	DynastyHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Dynasty Heart
		Lore: Crafted with the elegance of a bygone empire, it hums with refined, architectural grace. It carries the wisdom of ancient eastern travelers.
	}

	DirtHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Dirt Heart
		Lore: The most humble of origins, it contains the quiet, foundational heartbeat of Terraria itself. A simple but profound source of earthen vitality.
	}

	CrimstoneHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Crimstone Heart
		Lore: A grotesque chunk of the Crimson's core, throbbing with a sickly, fleshy rhythm. It radiates an aura of pure, visceral malice.
	}

	CrimsandHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Crimsand Heart
		Lore: Grains of blood-stained sand scrape together with every beat. It harbors a parasitic thirst born from the sprawling Crimson desert.
	}

	CoralstoneHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Coralstone Heart
		Lore: Formed in the vibrant shallows of the ocean, it holds the lifeblood of the sea. It whispers with the crashing of distant waves.
	}

	CloudHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Cloud Heart
		Lore: Light as a feather and continually drifting, this heart carries the breath of the sky. It pulses with the gentle rhythm of high-altitude winds.
	}

	CandyCaneHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Candy Cane Heart
		Lore: A festively striped, sugary heart that smells of peppermint and pure joy. It pulses with an energetic, hyperactive sweetness that invigorates the soul.
	}

	CactusHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Cactus Heart
		Lore: A prickly, water-retaining heart that beats with the stubborn survivalism of the harsh desert. Its tough exterior hides a surprisingly vital core.
	}

	BubbleHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Bubble Heart
		Lore: A delicate, iridescent heart that feels incredibly light and buoyant. It beats with a soft, gentle rhythm, as if ready to float away at any moment.
	}

	BorealWoodHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Boreal Wood Heart
		Lore: A chilled, wooden core that smells of pine and fresh snow. It pulses with the resilient, hardy spirit of the unforgiving snow biome.
	}

	ZephyrHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Zephyr Heart
		Lore: A nearly weightless heart that dances to the rhythm of the high-altitude winds. It carries the swift, unburdened freedom of the open sky.
	}

	YewWoodHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Yew Wood Heart
		Lore: A wooden heart carved from a poisonous tree, beating with a toxic, yet enduring life force. It contains the deceptive, deadly beauty of the ancient forests.
	}

	VampireHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Vampire Heart
		Lore: A dark, blood-red heart that constantly thirsts for the life essence of others. It beats with a ravenous, predatory rhythm that demands sustenance.
	}

	ValadiumHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Valadium Heart
		Lore: A gravity-defying heart that beats with a strange, otherworldly lightness. It pulses with an unstable, cosmic energy that distorts the space around it.
	}

	ThoriumHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Thorium Heart
		Lore: A crystalline heart infused with the strange, radioactive properties of thorium. It beats with a slow, heavy, and uniquely transformative resonance.
	}

	StormHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Storm Heart
		Lore: A crackling, tempestuous heart that roars with the fury of a raging thunderstorm. It surges with volatile, electric power and deafening thunder.
	}

	SmoothCoalHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Smooth Coal Heart
		Lore: A dense, blackened heart that harbors a deep, smoldering heat within. It beats with the steady, reliable endurance of long-burning fuel.
	}

	SeaBreezeHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Sea Breeze Heart
		Lore: A light, airy heart that carries the refreshing, invigorating scent of the ocean wind. It pulses with a carefree, liberating energy.
	}

	PermafrostHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Permafrost Heart
		Lore: An eternally frozen heart that emanates a bone-chilling, absolute zero aura. It beats with the relentless, unyielding harshness of an endless winter.
	}

	PearlHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Pearl Heart
		Lore: A smooth, lustrous core that radiates a calming, pure energy of the deep ocean. It holds the serene, unblemished beauty of a precious underwater treasure.
	}

	OpalHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Opal Heart
		Lore: A mesmerizing heart that flashes with a vibrant, shifting spectrum of colors. It pulses with a chaotic yet beautiful array of magical energies.
	}

	OnyxHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Onyx Heart
		Lore: A pitch-black heart that absorbs light and exudes an aura of sophisticated, dark elegance. It beats with a cold, calculating, and ruthless precision.
	}

	OmegaHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Omega Heart
		Lore: A technologically advanced core that pulses with an intimidating, synthetic rhythm. It holds the devastating power of an apocalyptic mechanical terror.
	}

	MossyMarineRockHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Mossy Marine Rock Heart
		Lore: Covered in deep-sea flora, this stony heart beats with the tranquil harmony of an underwater garden. It provides a soothing, natural resonance.
	}

	MagmaHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Magma Heart
		Lore: A scorching, semi-liquid heart that bubbles and churns with liquid fire. It contains the chaotic, destructive fury of a restless volcano.
	}

	LodestoneHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Lodestone Heart
		Lore: A heavy, magnetic core that hums with a powerful, polarizing energy field. It draws in raw vitality and binds it tightly within its metallic form.
	}

	LifeQuartzHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Life Quartz Heart
		Lore: A shimmering, translucent crystal that amplifies the natural life force around it. Its rhythmic pulsing matches the heartbeat of the world itself.
	}

	LichHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Lich Heart
		Lore: A phylactery of flesh, this heart beats with a cold, necrotic rhythm of the undead. It holds the dark, forbidden secrets of eternal, deathless existence.
	}

	IllumiteHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Illumite Heart
		Lore: A glowing, radiant heart that casts a brilliant, soothing light into the darkness. It hums with a harmonious, illuminating energy that banishes shadows.
	}

	IceboundStriderHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Icebound Strider Heart
		Lore: A frozen, crystalline heart that beats with the piercing chill of a brutal blizzard. It contains the untamed spirit of the apex predators of the tundra.
	}

	DormantHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Dormant Heart
		Lore: A cold, seemingly lifeless stone that hides a faint, barely perceptible heartbeat within. It waits patiently for the right catalyst to awaken its true power.
	}

	DepthsRockHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Depths Rock Heart
		Lore: A jagged, stony core that beats with the enduring, unyielding strength of the subterranean depths. It holds the crushing weight and stoic silence of the deep caverns.
	}

	ChampionHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Champion Heart
		Lore: A radiant heart forged from the triumphant spirit of a grand tournament victor. It pulses with the pride and unyielding determination of a true hero.
	}

	BrackishClumpHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Brackish Clump Heart
		Lore: A murky, algae-covered mass that slowly beats with the sluggish life of the stagnant waters. It smells of salt and decay, yet bursts with natural vitality.
	}

	BeholderHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Beholder Heart
		Lore: A grotesque, fleshy heart that seems to constantly watch you with an unseen gaze. It throbs with chaotic, otherworldly magic from beyond the stars.
	}

	AquaiteHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Aquaite Heart
		Lore: A pristine, watery core that flows with a constant, soothing, liquid rhythm. It reflects the pure, uncorrupted essence of aquatic life.
	}

	AbyssalHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Abyssal Heart
		Lore: Dredged from the crushing depths, this heart beats to the slow rhythm of the abyssal currents. It holds the oppressive weight of the deep ocean.
	}

	SoulOfBlightHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Soul Of Blight Heart
		Lore: A fragmented heart of pure disease, pulsing with a virulent, sickening aura. It carries the devastating blight of an ancient, terrifying plague.
	}

	EasterHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Easter Heart
		Lore: A pastel-colored heart radiating a vibrant, springtime joy and renewing vitality. It beats with the playful energy of a joyous spring morning.
	}

	CursedHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Cursed Heart
		Lore: Bound in mystical bindings, this heart beats with a sinister, malevolent curse. To hold it is to invite the wrath of forgotten, malicious spirits.
	}

	CornucopiaHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Cornucopia Heart
		Lore: Overflowing with a bountiful, festive energy, this heart brings a sense of absolute plenty. Its warm thrum promises endless feasts and joyous celebrations.
	}

	VoidstoneHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Voidstone Heart
		Lore: A cold, dense heart formed from the compressed nothingness of the void. It beats with a gravity that threatens to pull the soul out of your body.
	}

	UelibloomHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Uelibloom Heart
		Lore: Intertwined with the prolific flora of the jungle, this heart blooms with rampant life energy. It carries the stubborn resilience of nature reclaiming the land.
	}

	TwistingHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Twisting Heart
		Lore: A grotesque heart from the twisted nether, pulsing with a chaotic and unnatural vitality. Its unnatural shape seems to writhe and contort on its own.
	}

	TenebrisHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Tenebris Heart
		Lore: Carved from the abyssal darkness, this heart absorbs light and emanates a chilling void. It whispers of the lightless depths where colossal leviathans slumber.
	}

	SulphurousSandstoneHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Sulphurous Sandstone Heart
		Lore: Hardened by acidic tides, this porous heart traps the bitter essence of the ruined coastline. It hums with the memory of a long-lost ecosystem.
	}

	SulphurousSandHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Sulphurous Sand Heart
		Lore: Formed from the toxic dunes of the sulphurous sea, this heart steadily drips a corrosive brine. It beats with a sluggish, sickening rhythm.
	}

	SeaPrismHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Sea Prism Heart
		Lore: A crystallized shard of the sunken sea's magic, glimmering with aquatic luminescence. It holds the gentle, rhythmic beating of ancient ocean tides.
	}

	ScoriaHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Scoria Heart
		Lore: Forged in the fiery depths of the abyss, this heart pulses with intense geothermal heat. It radiates a scalding energy that sears the hands of the unworthy.
	}

	RottenHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Rotten Heart
		Lore: A decaying, malodorous clump of flesh from the corruption. It beats feebly, sustained only by a vile, dark magic.
	}

	ProfanedHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Profaned Heart
		Lore: A sacred, burning core corrupted by unholy flames. It commands a terrible awe, radiating a holy yet unforgiving light.
	}

	PolarizedHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Polarized Heart
		Lore: A magnetic core shifting constantly between opposing energies. It crackles with unpredictable and highly destructive power.
	}

	PlantyMushHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Planty Mush Heart
		Lore: A strange, symbiotic blend of jungle flora and fungal life. It pulsates softly, releasing an earthy, revitalizing aroma.
	}

	PerennialHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Perennial Heart
		Lore: A verdant, overgrown heart that sprouts fresh vines with every throb. It possesses the unstoppable, regenerative power of the jungle.
	}

	OceanHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Ocean Heart
		Lore: A vibrant, watery core that smells of salt and summer breezes. It embodies the endless depths and bountiful life of the sea.
	}

	NovaeSlugHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Novae Slug Heart
		Lore: A soft, radiant organ that once fueled a brilliant, star-forged creature. It pulses with a warm, comforting cosmic light.
	}

	NebulousHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Nebulous Heart
		Lore: A swirling galaxy of stardust contained within a single, delicate form. Holding it gives you a fleeting glimpse of the universe's creation.
	}

	NavystoneHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Navystone Heart
		Lore: A smooth, oceanic artifact steeped in the deep magic of the abyss. It thrums with a quiet, ancient power from beneath the waves.
	}

	MutatedHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Mutated Heart
		Lore: A grotesque, irregularly beating organ warped by unnatural forces. It constantly shifts and changes form, resisting all natural laws.
	}

	HardenedAstralSandHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Hardened Astral Sand Heart
		Lore: A petrified, cosmic relic forged in the intense heat of an astral impact. It feels heavy with the secrets of the universe.
	}

	GravistarHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Gravistar Heart
		Lore: A dense, gravity-warping core that pulls everything towards it. It beats to the relentless rhythm of a dying star.
	}

	GehennaHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Gehenna Heart
		Lore: A sinister, burning relic dredged from the darkest pits of the underworld. It screams silently with the agony of damned souls.
	}

	FungalHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Fungal Heart
		Lore: A spongy, glowing mass heavily infected by the glowing mushroom biome. It scatters a cloud of luminescent spores with every beat.
	}

	ExodiumClusterHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Exodium Cluster Heart
		Lore: A jagged clump of space-faring ores that miraculously pulses with life. It draws in ambient energy like a dying black hole.
	}

	EutrophicSandHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Eutrophic Sand Heart
		Lore: A bright, crystal-infused heart found hidden in the depths of the Sunken Sea. It beats with a soothing, aquatic tranquility.
	}

	DynamoStemHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Dynamo Stem Heart
		Lore: A mechanized, botanical core humming with electrical life. It bridges the gap between nature's resilience and technological progress.
	}

	DraconicHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Draconic Heart
		Lore: A massive, scaly heart taken from the remains of a mythical wyrm. It surges with the ancient, unyielding might of dragons.
	}

	DarkPlasmicHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Dark Plasmic Heart
		Lore: A volatile orb of dark energy that bends the light around it. It writhes with chaotic, shadowy forces eager to be unleashed.
	}

	CrystallizedToxicHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Crystallized Toxic Heart
		Lore: A brittle, radioactive organ glowing with a sickening green light. It throbs with the concentrated malice of a corrosive wasteland.
	}

	CryonicHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Cryonic Heart
		Lore: Encased in unmelting, magical ice harvested from the tundra's depths. It possesses a freezing serenity that calms the soul.
	}

	CryogenHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Cryogen Heart
		Lore: A jagged, biting crystal of absolute frost that once imprisoned a great power. Its icy beats send shivers down your spine.
	}

	CosmiliteHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Cosmilite Heart
		Lore: A sleek, indestructible core forged from a god-devouring alloy. It hums with an intimidating, high-frequency resonance.
	}

	CorpusHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Corpus Heart
		Lore: A horrifying amalgamation of bloody tissue and sinew, pulsing with morbid vitality. It serves as a grim reminder of the crimson's unstoppable growth.
	}

	CinderplateHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Cinderplate Heart
		Lore: A jagged, metallic heart seared by volcanic heat and ash. It crunches like hot coals with every slow beat.
	}

	CelestialRemainsHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Celestial Remains Heart
		Lore: A solemn relic left behind by the pillars of the lunar apocalypse. It echoes with the eerie silence of the cosmos.
	}

	CalamitousHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Calamitous Heart
		Lore: A volatile, terrifying artifact born of pure destruction and catastrophic energy. Merely holding it brings visions of the world's end.
	}

	BrimstoneSlagHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Brimstone Slag Heart
		Lore: Forged in the ruined, fiery crags of the Brimstone Crags. It radiates a hellish heat and smells of sulfur and ash.
	}

	BloodyWormHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Bloody Worm Heart
		Lore: A grotesque, fleshy lump torn from a massive sanguine annelid. It squirms slightly in your hand, desperate to consume.
	}

	BlazingHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Blazing Heart
		Lore: A searing core of pure, concentrated fire that threatens to melt anything it touches. It roars with the eternal fury of the underworld.
	}

	AuricHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Auric Heart
		Lore: A divine core shimmering with unimaginable golden power. It embodies the very essence of a god's boundless lifeforce.
	}

	AstralStoneHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Astral Stone Heart
		Lore: Hewn from the bedrock of the cosmos itself, unyielding and eternal. Its heavy beats reverberate through the ground beneath you.
	}

	AstralSnowHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Astral Snow Heart
		Lore: A delicate, frozen core formed from the chilling fallout of an astral collision. It hums a silent melody of the frozen void.
	}

	AstralSandstoneHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Astral Sandstone Heart
		Lore: Hardened by cosmic radiation and the passage of eons, it contains the compressed fury of a shooting star. It shines with a blinding, starry luster.
	}

	AstralSandHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Astral Sand Heart
		Lore: Composed of shifting, crystalline grains from a star-blasted desert. It flows endlessly yet somehow maintains its vital form.
	}

	AstralMonolithHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Astral Monolith Heart
		Lore: A heavy, monolithic stone heart that acts as a beacon for the astral infection. It throbs with a slow, terrifying, and ancient rhythm.
	}

	AstralIceHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Astral Ice Heart
		Lore: Frozen solid by the absolute zero temperatures of deep space. It emanates a chilling aura that slows the blood of those who draw near.
	}

	AstralHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Astral Heart
		Lore: A crystallized fragment of cosmic power, pulsing with the eerie purple glow of the astral blight. It carries the weight of a thousand dying stars.
	}

	AstralDirtHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Astral Dirt Heart
		Lore: Infused with the extraterrestrial energy of a localized meteor strike. Stardust constantly falls from its steadily beating surface.
	}

	AstralClayHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Astral Clay Heart
		Lore: Molded from the alien soil of a fallen star, this heart feels strangely pliable yet eternally durable. It echoes with the silent whispers of the cosmos.
	}

	AstralBossHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Astral Boss Heart
		Lore: A majestic core salvaged from a fallen starborn entity. It burns with the unfathomable, cold fire of the astral infection.
	}

	ArmoredHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Armored Heart
		Lore: Encased in an impenetrable, metallic shell, it survived crushing blows that would shatter normal cores. Its rhythmic thud is like a hammer striking an anvil.
	}

	AquaticHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Aquatic Heart
		Lore: A crystalline organ that constantly weeps fresh, pure water. Holding it makes one feel an undeniable connection to the vast seas.
	}

	AmbergrisHeart: {
		Tooltip: ""
		DisplayName: Ambergris Heart
